{
  "_comment": "Body for forms.batchUpdate. First call forms.create with {\"info\": {\"title\": \"Unipicks: 1-minute student survey\", \"documentTitle\": \"Unipicks student survey\"}}. The API cannot set response validation: after running, set Q7 \"Response validation: Email\" in the editor. Also set the confirmation message in Settings and the theme (see brand/README.md). Remove this _comment key before sending.",
